From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 06:46:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Compact guests step and time-slot grid to fit without
 scrolling

Adults grid, children/pets steppers: tighter padding/margins/gaps. Time slot buttons (dates step): single row of 4 instead of 2x2, smaller icon/text. Frees enough vertical space that Back/Next stay reachable without scrolling on typical mobile viewports. Pure sizing/spacing changes, same visual style and structure.
